invariant: INV-13
file: quic_fail.c
catches: ticket_epoch_quic
reason: ch_quic_init zeroes the epoch fields when it refuses a CA build's
  ticket that the stored epoch retired, so its caller reads CH_EPOCH_NONE
  where ch_connect's reads CH_EPOCH_REVOKED, and cannot tell that refusal
  from any other. bin/ticket_epoch_quic requires the stored epoch, the
  ticket's epoch and CH_EPOCH_REVOKED after the refusal.

--- old
    memset(q, 0, sizeof *q);
    q->t.epoch = epoch;
    q->t.epoch_seen = epoch_seen;
    q->t.epoch_status = epoch_status;
--- new
    memset(q, 0, sizeof *q);
    (void)epoch;
    (void)epoch_seen;
    (void)epoch_status;
